Retry + Circuit Breaker + Fallback → Handles transient failures, prevents cascading failures, and provides graceful degradation.

Bulkhead + Rate Limiter → Isolates critical services and protects resources under high load.

Time Limiter → Ensures timely responses.

Idempotent APIs → Work alongside Retry and Circuit Breaker to prevent duplicate operations.

